{"script":"m_3_8_4","des":"村民布彻的爸爸（d010p男）处得","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","y":-180,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","y":-180,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":590,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":590,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"布彻的父亲","text":"[show]布彻是怎么失踪的？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"布彻的父亲","text":"[show]哼，那小子是自己逞英雄，一个人跑到野外采药之后不见的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"布彻的父亲","text":"[show]真是莫名其妙的小█崽子！老子都说了，凭老子这把力气，足够养他一辈子，结果他居然跑去送命！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"布彻的父亲","text":"[show]他以为这样就能减轻我的负担？这样就能让老子开心不成？真是█████了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":590,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]那个……为什么您觉得他是特意送命？难道就不会是遭遇了不测……？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":590,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"布彻的父亲","text":"[show]为什么？哈！因为那小█崽子“失踪”之前留下了一笔钱！他█的，给老子，留下了，一笔钱！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"布彻的父亲","text":"[show]老子活了大半辈子，还要一个做不了重活的痨病鬼可怜老子！这个痨病鬼还是老子自己的崽！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"布彻的父亲","text":"[show]哈，真是█████了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[show]（布彻的父亲转过身去，只是重重地呼吸，不再说话。）[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara1"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","y":-180,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]哇……这人是怎么回事啊。自己儿子失踪了，都不见一点悲伤，反而在这里乱发脾气。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","y":-180,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_13","text":"米托拉……"},{"tag":"tag_13","text":"那是他表达悲伤的方式。"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[cm]"}